/* Gn030: SURFACE_CURVE associated_geometry is a 3D LINE in the host PLANE (Z=0) instead of a 2D PCURVE; Parasolid-origin style; 3D curve geometrically consistent with PLANE surface but stored in 3D form not 2D parametric; importers hardcoded for 2D pcurve form trip; compliant kernels must heal by deriving the parameter curve from the 3D curve + host surface */
